<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>About Wuzwear Industry</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="../css/whyus.css">
</head>
<body>
     <%- include('partials/nav') %>

    <header class="hero-section reveal">
        <img src="../photos/about-us.webp" alt="Tailor working on apparel manufacturing" class="hero-image">
    </header>

    <main class="container">
        
        <section class="about-intro reveal">
            <h2>About Wuzwear Industry</h2>
            <p>At <strong>Wuzwear Industry</strong>, we specialize in customized <span class="highlight">apparel manufacturing</span> and bring even the most complex customer designs to life. Our mission is to deliver top-quality, tailor-made clothing to brands and businesses across the globe.</p>
            <p>We provide endless customization options on fabrics, designs, and patterns. Whether you are a growing fashion label or an established clothing company, <strong>Wuzwear Industry</strong> ensures your brand gets the unique edge it deserves.</p>
            <p>From custom shirts and sweatshirts to shorts and sublimation printing, we provide nearly every customization service a clothing brand needs to create standout collections. If you can imagine it, we can make it.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="about-grid reveal">
            <div class="grid-column">
                <h3>Serving Industry for More Than a Decade</h3>
                <p>With a client base of over <strong>3000+ satisfied customers</strong>, <strong>Wuzwear Industry</strong> has been delivering premium-quality apparel for more than a decade through its manufacturing facility in Karachi, Pakistan. At the same time, our brand name and business are officially registered in Sheridan, Wyoming, USA.</p>
                <p><strong>Wuzwear Industry</strong> ships worldwide and also offers printing facilities on blank shirts for customers in the USA, making it the perfect choice for promotional campaigns and corporate wear.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="grid-column">
                <h3>How Did We Start?</h3>
                <p>The company began its journey under the name <strong>Wuzwear Industry</strong>, starting as a flagship project in a small workspace with a passionate team of just four people. The vision was clear from day one — to assist international clients by providing the best solutions for overseas apparel manufacturing.</p>
                <p>Today, our mission remains strong: to support global clothing brands by producing high-quality apparel and helping them grow their business.</p>
                <p>By producing high-quality apparel and helping them grow their clothing lines with unmatched reliability and expertise.</p>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <section class="dark-banner reveal">
        <div class="container banner-flex">
            <div class="banner-column">
                <h3>Our Mission</h3>
                <p>At <strong>Wuzwear Industry</strong>, our mission is to be a trusted and dependable partner for international clothing brands by providing on-demand customization for their apparel lines. Over the years, we have successfully achieved this mission and have become a preferred choice for our customers worldwide.</p>
                <p>We also strive to enhance the presence of locally manufactured products in the international market. We strongly believe in the potential of our products and the value of the services we deliver to clients across the globe.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="banner-column">
                <h3>Our Values</h3>
                <ul class="values-list">
                    <li>We remain grateful to God for His continuous blessings.</li>
                    <li>We believe in constant learning and improvement through knowledge and implementation.</li>
                    <li>We stay motivated and dedicated to fulfilling our promise of quality and service.</li>
                    <li>We honor our commitments — we deliver what we say.</li>
                    <li>We value the integrity, hard work, and dedication of our team and associates.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="container reveal">
        <div class="vision-section">
            <div class="vision-left">
                
                <h3>Our Vision</h3>
                <p>At <strong>Wuzwear Industry</strong>, our vision is to deliver exceptional quality craftsmanship through our strong commitment to garment care and excellence.</p>
                <p>We strive to achieve this under completely sweatshop-free manufacturing conditions, ensuring both our employees and our customers remain satisfied. Our top priority is building a thriving organization and a loyal customer base founded on trust and quality.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="vision-right">
                
                <img src="../photos/about-us1.webp" alt="Tailor working with yellow fabric" class="vision-img">
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <div class="chat-widget">
        <div class="chat-icon">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-message"></i>
            <span class="notification-badge">1</span>
        </div>
        <span class="widget-label">We Are Here!</span>
    </div>
<%- include('partials/popup') %>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
    <script src="../js/about-us.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
